#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0641 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0641 (Rule: AGETXT not present in dataset). Executable part only (the rule is Partially Executable, possible overreporting). DM without an AGETXT column -> the rule executes and stays silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AGE     type=Num  label="Age"
col AGEU    type=Char label="Age Units"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001 | 45 | YEARS
S1 | DM | S1-002 | 52 | YEARS
